NOTE ON GAME CONTENT

This app contains no game assets. All loot names and gear images are fetched
live from prototrack.gg at runtime and are not redistributed with this source
code or with the release APK. The Division 2 is a trademark of Ubisoft
Entertainment. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ubisoft or
prototrack.gg. Please respect prototrack.gg's terms of use and their
rate limits if you run your own instance of this app.